# Module Gestion Annonces

- Treat `module-gestion-annonces-final.md` as the source of truth. Read it before implementing or changing related code.
- Keep the module simple, business-driven, and implementation-ready. Do not add unnecessary entities, architecture, or abstractions.
- Build around exactly these 7 entities: `Product`, `ResourceListing`, `PostAttachment`, `Comment`, `GroupPurchase`, `GroupParticipant`, `Favorite`.
- `ResourceListing` is the core entity. Its type is mandatory at creation: `SURPLUS`, `DEMANDE`, `GROUP_BUYING`.
- Keep the main module in Spring Boot. Use Python only for AI-related enrichment.
- Replace chat with threaded comments only.
- Respect the dedicated companion rules for business logic, comments/realtime, AI/integrations, and API/validation.
